// ==============================================================================
// File: tests/test1_basic.toy
// Purpose: Basic sanity test verifying fundamental compiler features.
//
// What it Tests:
//  - Variable declaration and numeric assignment statements (a = 10; b = 20;).
//  - Simple binary arithmetic addition (c = a + b;).
//  - Console print statements (print(a); print(c);).
//  - Verifies baseline lexing, AST construction, and basic TAC emission.
// ==============================================================================

a = 10;
b = 20;
print(a);
c = a + b;
print(c);
